    "description_raw": "This spell functions like minor creation, except that you can also create an object of mineral nature: stone, crystal, metal, or the like. The duration of the created item varies with its relative hardness and rarity, as indicated on the following table.\n\nHardness and Rarity Examples\nDuration\n\nVegetable matter\n2 hr./level\n\nStone, crystal, base metals\n1 hr./level\n\nPrecious metals\n20 min./level\n\nGems\n10 min./level\n\nRare metal*\n1 round/level\n\n* Includes adamantine, alchemical silver, and mithral. You can’t use major creation to create a cold iron item.",
